  "id": "burn-injuries",
  "term": "burn injuries",
  "definition": "Burn injuries are injuries caused by burning that can lead to long-term problems for survivors. In the social and public-health context described here, they are important because rising numbers of new cases and survivors can reflect weak prevention measures and limited rehabilitation services.",
